complexTableTest is test
complexTableTest purpose "every function of complex.h on the special values of Annex G and some ordinary points, against an exact reference: a row is the arguments and the expected parts as bits and tolerances"
complexTableTest verifies complexExponential givesCexp
complexTableTest verifies complexLogarithm givesClog
complexTableTest verifies complexSquareRoot givesCsqrt
complexTableTest verifies complexSine givesCsin
complexTableTest verifies complexCosine givesCcos
complexTableTest verifies complexTangent givesCtan
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseSine givesCasin
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseCosine givesCacos
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseTangent givesCatan
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicSine givesCsinh
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicCosine givesCcosh
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicTangent givesCtanh
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseHyperbolicSine givesCasinh
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseHyperbolicCosine givesCacosh
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseHyperbolicTangent givesCatanh
complexTableTest verifies complexConjugate givesConj
complexTableTest verifies complexProjection givesCproj
complexTableTest verifies complexMagnitude givesCabs
complexTableTest verifies complexArgument givesCarg
complexTableTest verifies complexRealPart givesCreal
complexTableTest verifies complexImaginaryPart givesCimag
complexTableTest verifies complexPower givesCpow
complexTableTest verifies complexExponentialSingle givesCexpf
complexTableTest verifies complexLogarithmSingle givesClogf
complexTableTest verifies complexSquareRootSingle givesCsqrtf
complexTableTest verifies complexSineSingle givesCsinf
complexTableTest verifies complexCosineSingle givesCcosf
complexTableTest verifies complexTangentSingle givesCtanf
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseSineSingle givesCasinf
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseCosineSingle givesCacosf
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseTangentSingle givesCatanf
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicSineSingle givesCsinhf
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicCosineSingle givesCcoshf
complexTableTest verifies complexHyperbolicTangentSingle givesCtanhf
complexTableTest verifies complexInverseHyperbolicSineSingle givesCasinhf
